  I am working on OMAP5912 OSK in Linux environment.
Recently I bought QVGA LCD Mdule from Mistral.
  In the make menuconfig of Linux-2.6.22 I had chosen the Mistral-QVGA LCD module and ported the uImage on to the OSK5912.
  The Plug-in Mistral QVGA LCD MODULE got activated.
   
  I request you to please help me by giving an example test program for 
